# Level 3, gained for {5}{U} from level 2, adds "whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 1/1 blue and
# red Otter with prowess". The Bolt cast afterwards makes a second Otter, and that trigger resolves before the Bolt
# does. The first Otter was there for prowess to pump on the Lotus and the Bolt (3/3); the second was not (1/1).
# Level 2 with an empty graveyard has no target, so its trigger does nothing.

